{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"f17302e149fed1e38f90b58a032375190a256d10c3b29f06d530401a01210ee2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["为事奉上帝而活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所以，弟兄姊妹，我凭上帝的怜悯劝你们献上自己的身体，作圣洁、蒙上帝悦纳的活祭。你们理当这样事奉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你们不可追随这世界的潮流，要随着思想的不断更新而改变，这样就能明辨上帝的旨意，知道什么是良善、纯全、蒙祂悦纳的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我凭上帝赐给我的恩典劝告各位，不要自视过高，要照着上帝赐给各人的信心中肯地看待自己。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就像我们每个身体有许多肢体，各肢体功能不同，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我们虽然人多，但在基督里组成一个身体，彼此联结，互为肢体。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我们照所得的恩典各有不同的恩赐。说预言的，要按着信心的程度说预言；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["服侍的，要专心服侍；教导的，要专心教导；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["劝勉的，要专心劝勉；施舍的，要慷慨施舍；治理的，要殷勤治理；怜悯的，要甘心怜悯。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["相爱相顾"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["爱必须真诚。要痛恨邪恶，一心向善。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["要彼此相爱如同手足，互相尊重，彼此谦让。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["要殷勤，不可懒惰，要常常火热地事奉主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["盼望中要有喜乐，患难中要坚忍，祷告要恒切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["圣徒有缺乏，要慷慨帮助；客人来访，要热诚款待。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["迫害你们的，要为他们祝福；要祝福，不可咒诅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["要与喜乐的人同乐，与哀哭的人同哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["要彼此和睦。不可心高气傲，反要俯就卑微的人。不可自以为聪明。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["不要以恶报恶，要留心去做众人看为好的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["如果可能，总要尽力与人和睦相处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["亲爱的弟兄姊妹，不要私自报复，要交给发烈怒的上帝，因为圣经上说：",{"text":"“主说，‘申冤在我，我必报应。’","poem":1},{"noteId":54},{"text":"”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["相反，",{"text":"“你的仇敌若饿了，就给他吃的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若渴了，就给他喝的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这样做是把炭火堆在他头上。”","poem":1},{"noteId":55}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["你不可被恶所胜，反要以善胜恶。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":54,"caller":"+","text":"申命记32:35。","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":19}},{"noteId":55,"caller":"+","text":"箴言25:21、22。","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ROM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}